<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0;net8.0;netstandard2.1;netstandard2.0;</TargetFrameworks>
    <RootNamespace>LiteOrm.Common</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyVersion>8.1.13.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>8.1.13.0</FileVersion>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <VersionPrefix>8.1.13</VersionPrefix>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <Title>LiteOrm.Common</Title>
    <Authors>danjiewu</Authors>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://danjiewu.github.io/LiteOrm</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.nuget.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageTags>orm;sql;oracle;mysql;sql server;sqlite</PackageTags>
    <Description>LiteOrm 公共库：表达式树、SQL 片段、表元数据与公共特性，由 LiteOrm 包自动引用。</Description>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
      8.1.13:
      - AOT 下 [TableJoin]/[ForeignType]/[ForeignColumn] 与 [Column(Constant = ...)] 由 TableInfoGenerator 编译期写入 TableInfo（JoinedTables、ColumnInfo.ForeignTables/ForeignColumn、Constant），CommonTableInfoProvider 装配出完整的 TableView 与 TableDefinition.ConstFilter，与 JIT 一致。
      - LambdaExprConverter 支持嵌套参数上下文：新增带父转换器的构造重载，子转换器继承外层参数映射并共享别名编号；多参数 Lambda 全部注册（param[0] 为 T0 根表，其余参数获得新别名）。
      - 破坏性变更：删除 Expr.Exists/Expr.ExistsRelated 的泛型重载，LogicExpr 场景改用 Type 重载 Expr.Exists(typeof(T), ...)；删除 Where&lt;T&gt; Lambda 扩展方法，改用 Where(Expr.Lambda&lt;T&gt;(...))。
      - 破坏性变更：删除 TableRef 抽象类，成员移入 JoinedTable；ColumnRef.Table 类型由 TableRef? 改为 JoinedTable?。
      - 修复内层 Lambda 同名参数遮蔽外层参数的 bug：Expr.Exists 等嵌套 Lambda 参数与外层同名时，转换完成后外层参数引用不再失效。
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/danjiewu/LiteOrm.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <LangVersion>14.0</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net8.0' OR '$(TargetFramework)' == 'net10.0'">
    <IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(TargetFramework)|$(Platform)'=='Release|netstandard2.0|AnyCPU'">
    <DocumentationFile>bin\Release\LiteOrm.Common.xml</DocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(TargetFramework)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|netstandard2.0|AnyCPU'">
    <DocumentationFile>bin\Debug\LiteOrm.Common.xml</DocumentationFile>
    <OutputPath />
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="DAO\**" />
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="DAO\**" />
    <None Remove="DAO\**" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.nuget.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="..\icon.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net10.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="10.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net8.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1' OR '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\LiteOrm.Generators\LiteOrm.Generators.csproj" OutputItemType="Analyzer" ReferenceOutputAssembly="false" />
    <None Include="..\LiteOrm.Generators\bin\$(Configuration)\netstandard2.0\LiteOrm.Generators.dll" Pack="true" PackagePath="analyzers/dotnet/cs" Visible="false" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>